{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "name": "n1",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "In this town, it's impossible to miss a basketball shot. Even our grandma shoots better than Steph Curry, and she's seventy-eight,",
   "start": 0.113,
   "dur": 6.318
  },
  {
   "id": "btw",
   "name": "btw1",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "by the way.",
   "start": 6.516,
   "dur": 0.63
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "name": "n2",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Our mailman delivered packages from half-court, our baker shot three-pointers with bread, and our mayor thought he was LeBron James.",
   "start": 7.599,
   "dur": 6.502
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "name": "n3",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "But one day, our coach went on vacation, and my best friend Jake somehow missed a wide-open layup.",
   "start": 14.554,
   "dur": 4.968
  },
  {
   "id": "j_bro",
   "name": "j_bro",
   "speaker": "jake",
   "text": "Bro?",
   "start": 20.032,
   "dur": 0.676
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "name": "n4",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "I saw this as an opportunity to become the greatest basketball player alive.",
   "start": 21.671,
   "dur": 3.82
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h1",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 25.66,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h2",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 26.215,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h3",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 26.769,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
   "name": "d4",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "While they're out partying, I'm out here grinding,",
   "start": 27.454,
   "dur": 2.088
  },
  {
   "id": "btw",
   "name": "btw4",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "by the way.",
   "start": 29.666,
   "dur": 0.63
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "name": "n5",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "After twelve hours of training, I finally tested my new jumper.",
   "start": 30.636,
   "dur": 3.115
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h4",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 34.657,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h5",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 35.256,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h6",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 35.884,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "name": "n6",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Grandma went zero for thirty, the mailman got fired, and our mayor blamed the wind. We were indoors,",
   "start": 37.787,
   "dur": 5.298
  },
  {
   "id": "btw",
   "name": "btw6",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "by the way.",
   "start": 43.17,
   "dur": 0.63
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h7",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 43.969,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h8",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 44.597,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h9",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 45.282,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "n7",
   "name": "n7",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "While I was grinding, Jake discovered a blinking light underneath his basketball.",
   "start": 46.335,
   "dur": 3.726
  },
  {
   "id": "j_wifi",
   "name": "j_wifi",
   "speaker": "jake",
   "text": "Bro, why does my basketball need Wi-Fi?",
   "start": 50.203,
   "dur": 2.179
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h10",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 52.495,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h11",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 53.049,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h12",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 53.604,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "j_stop",
   "name": "j_stop",
   "speaker": "jake",
   "text": "BRO, STOP!",
   "start": 54.158,
   "dur": 1.082
  },
  {
   "id": "n8",
   "name": "n8",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "We followed the signal into our coach's garage, and discovered something that changed everything.",
   "start": 55.749,
   "dur": 4.46
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h13",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 60.379,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "n9",
   "name": "n9",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Our coach had secretly controlled every basketball shot for twenty years. He literally gave the entire town aimbot.",
   "start": 62.508,
   "dur": 6.051
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "name": "n10",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "When our coach returned, he admitted that he'd forgotten his controller charger on vacation.",
   "start": 69.408,
   "dur": 4.423
  },
  {
   "id": "m_lebron",
   "name": "m_lebron",
   "speaker": "mayor",
   "text": "So I'm not better than LeBron?",
   "start": 74.114,
   "dur": 2.056
  },
  {
   "id": "c_dribble",
   "name": "c_dribble",
   "speaker": "coach",
   "text": "You can't even dribble.",
   "start": 76.368,
   "dur": 1.443
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "name": "n11",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Once the coach plugged his controller back in, everyone became good at basketball again.",
   "start": 79.0,
   "dur": 4.207
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h14",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 84.114,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "huss",
   "name": "h15",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Huss!",
   "start": 84.713,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "hussL",
   "name": "h16",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "HUSS!",
   "start": 85.341,
   "dur": 0.486
  },
  {
   "id": "j_aimbot",
   "name": "j_aimbot",
   "speaker": "jake",
   "text": "BRO, THE AIMBOT IS ON!",
   "start": 86.507,
   "dur": 1.474
  },
  {
   "id": "d11",
   "name": "d11",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "Still grinding,",
   "start": 88.151,
   "dur": 0.868
  },
  {
   "id": "btw",
   "name": "btw11",
   "speaker": "alex",
   "text": "by the way.",
   "start": 89.087,
   "dur": 0.63
  }
 ],
